Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 09:59:54 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Phase 1: custom code to Drupal 11 APIs; CKEditor 4 to
 CKEditor 5 update

acme_tools:
- user_roles(TRUE) -> Role::loadMultiple() minus anonymous.
- module_load_include() -> \Drupal::moduleHandler()->loadInclude().
- watchdog_exception() -> Error::logException() (drupal-rector).
- format_size() -> ByteSizeMarkup::create() (drupal-rector).
- core_version_requirement ^10.3 || ^11.
- acme_tools_post_update_ckeditor5_migration(): moves every CKEditor 4
  text format to CKEditor 5 with core's smart-default settings, validates
  all of them before saving any, then uninstalls drupal/ckeditor. Runs
  with drush updb on the phase 1 release.

acme_theme: base theme classy -> stable9. Classy left core in 10.0, so
this theme could not be installed even on the baseline; stable9 is in
core in 10 and 11 and the theme ships no templates or CSS that relied on
Classy's markup.
